<title>AUSTRIA: SAUDI MINISTER SAYS WOULD LIKE HIGHER OIL PRICE.</title>
<headline>SAUDI MINISTER SAYS WOULD LIKE HIGHER OIL PRICE.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saudi Arabian oil minister Ali bin Ibrahim al-Naimi said on Wednesday he would like to see an increase in oil prices.</p>
<p>&quot;Yes, we would like to see the price higher,&quot; he told reporters after a bilateral session held with the Iranian and Venezuelan oil ministers in the OPEC Secretary General Rilwanu Lukman's hotel suite.</p>
</text>
